            <ArticleTitle>[Fatal cardiac tamponade associated with total parenteral nutrition].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>158-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Cardiac tamponade linked to parenteral nutrition is a rare complication, but often fatal. This clinical study describes a case in which this complication occurs, with a review of literature on the subject and several recommendations for prevention and treatment.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
